{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_85078",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A <em>C</em>-glycosyl comprising β-<small>D</small>-glucose in which the anomeric hydroxy group is replaced by a 4-chloro-3-(4-ethoxybenzyl)phenyl group. Used (in the form of its propanediol monohydrate) to improve glycemic control, along with diet and exercise, in adults with type 2 diabetes."
  ],
